  "effectiveDate": "2021-04-07",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300) #10032, eff 11-22-11; ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (See Revision Note #3 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300)",
